      "title": "调味",
      "instruction": "在锅中加入蚝油、生抽、盐、鸡精、白砂糖和番茄酱。",
      "duration_sec": 60,
      "tips": [
        "酸甜或咸鲜口味可根据个人喜好微调比例"
      ],
      "produces": null,
      "image": "steps/vegetable_dish_jia-chang-ri-ben-dou-fu/step_8.jpg"
    },
